7.html"><span>[09:00]</span>\n <p class="author">苏生半</p>\n <p>长生：从抽取精品武学开始</p></a></li>\n <li><a href="/shu/114210.html"><span>[09:00]</span>\n <p class="author">崔云楼</p>\n <p>从斩魔积善开始受禄长生</p></a></li>\n <li><a href="/shu/112209.html"><span>[09:00]</span>\n <p class="author">水一更</p>\n <p>斩妖司十二年，我为夜天子</p></a></li>\n </ul>\n </div>\n <div class="box">\n <div class="title"><a href="/top/goodnum/">热门收藏</a></div>\n <div class="vote">\n <a href="/shu/93531.html">\n <span class="layui-badge">1</span>\n <img src="https://img.110txt.com/93531/1784652.jpg" alt="恶雌娇软：深陷五个兽夫修罗场">\n <p class="bookname">恶雌娇软：深陷五个兽夫修罗场</p>\n <p class="author">莲子呢</p>\n <p class="intro" style="display: -webkit-box;-webkit-line-clamp: 4;-webkit-box-orient: vertical;overflow: hidden;text-overflow: ellipsis;">沈棠一觉醒来穿成了三百斤的大胖子，却拥有五个绝色兽夫。\n美艳红狐，霸道黑豹，阴郁白蛇，人鱼暴君，硬汉金鹰上将……各个宽肩窄腰大长腿，八块腹肌堪比男模！\n原主又丑又懒遭人嫌，兽夫们避如蛇蝎，她还妄图霸王</p>\n </a>\n </div>\n <ul class="vlist">\n <li><a href="/shu/545.html"><span\n class="layui-badge layui-bg-orange">2</span>\n <p class="bookname">LOL：这是个治愈游戏</p>\n <p class="author">奶茶派教主</p></a></li>\n </ul>\n <ul class="vlist">\n <li><a href="/shu/1620.html"><span\n class="layui-badge layui-bg-green">3</span>\n <p class="bookname">老祖她祭天啦</p>\n <p class="author">修仙呢没空</p></a></li>\n </ul>\n <ul class="vlist">\n <li><a href="/shu/361.html"><span\n class="layui-badge layui-bg-blue">4</span>\n <p class="bookname">许你盛世安宁</p>\n <p class="author">江山一顾</p></a></li>\n </ul>\n <ul class="vlist">\n <li><a href="/shu/442.html"><span\n class="layui-badge layui-bg-cyan">5</span>\n <p class="bookname">重生大佬种田开挂养萌娃</p>\n <p class="author">彩虹坡</p></a></li>\n </ul>\n <ul class="vlist">\n <li><a href="/shu/1681.html"><span\n class="layui-badge layui-bg-gray">6</span>\n <p class="bookname">我在春秋当权臣</p>\n <p class="author">秃头小保安</p></a></li>\n </ul>\n <ul class="vlist">\n <li><a href="/shu/93531.html"><span\n class="layui-badge layui-bg-gray">7</span>\n <p class="bookname">恶雌娇软：深陷五个兽夫修罗场</p>\n <p class="author">莲子呢</p